SUMMARY:Door 10: Every input is a stranger
DESCRIPTION:DO: Treat web pages\, files and emails a model reads as untrust
 ed\, and limit what they can trigger.\nDON’T: Rely on the system prompt 
 as a security boundary - assume it leaks and can be overridden.\n\nLesson 
 learnt (EchoLeak\, Jun 2025): Researchers showed a crafted email could mak
 e Microsoft 365 Copilot leak data with zero clicks (CVE-2025-32711). Micro
 soft fixed it server-side.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.githu
 b.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=10\n\nAI-assisted · reviewed by aware-by-desi
 gn · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=10
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
