SUMMARY:Door 11: Hire the human\, not the deepfake
DESCRIPTION:DO: Verify remote candidates with live on-camera checks\, ID ve
 rification and references you call yourself.\nDON’T: Skip checks because
  the interview went well - fake IT-worker schemes target remote roles.\n\n
 Lesson learnt (KnowBe4\, Jul 2024): The security firm hired a remote engin
 eer who was a North Korean operative using a stolen identity and an AI-enh
 anced photo. Its monitoring flagged malware on his new laptop.\n\nOpen the
  door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=11\n\nAI-a
 ssisted · reviewed by aware-by-design · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH 
 AHWG
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=11
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
