SUMMARY:Door 12: Fact-check the machine
DESCRIPTION:DO: Check AI answers against a primary source before you publis
 h\, sign or decide.\nDON’T: Cite sources you haven’t opened - AI can i
 nvent quotes\, cases and references.\n\nLesson learnt (Deloitte Australia\
 , Oct 2025): Deloitte agreed to partially refund the Australian government
  for an A$440\,000 report that contained AI-generated errors\, including r
 eferences that did not exist.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.gi
 thub.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=12\n\nAI-assisted · reviewed by aware-by-d
 esign · an initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=12
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
