SUMMARY:Door 13: Gift cards are for gifts
DESCRIPTION:DO: Pause and tell someone when a “tax office”\, “tech su
 pport” or “boss” demands urgent payment.\nDON’T: Pay anyone in gif
 t cards or crypto on request - the demand itself is the scam.\n\nLesson le
 arnt (FBI Internet Crime Report\, Apr 2025): Americans reported losing US$
 9.3 billion to cryptocurrency-related fraud in 2024\, up 66% on the year b
 efore.\n\nOpen the door: https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent20
 26/?day=13\n\nAI-assisted · reviewed by aware-by-design · an initiative 
 of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
URL:https://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=13
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
